  "note": "Observation.code -> Medical Core parameter. Deliberately only plain, unambiguous names: WardSynQ Observations carry codeSystem 'unspecified' in this build, and a coded system (LOINC, a site's own lab dictionary) is ADAPTER work by the WardSynQ invariant that no adapter-specific logic belongs in core. Guessing a code here would map a real lab onto the wrong parameter silently, which is worse than not reading it: an unmapped code is never dropped, it is recorded in provenance.unmapped so the gap is visible and fixable.",
